    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant and mesmerizing world of MANA, where strategic brilliance meets explosive visual spectacle! In this thrilling game, players engage in intense battles by harnessing the power of angles to generate an array of dazzling shapes and colors. MANA takes the age-old concept of strategic warfare and infuses it with a visually stunning and uniquely dynamic twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1. Shape Your Destiny:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the power of angles as you strategically choose the trajectory of your colorful shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every angle matters \u2013 plan your moves carefully to outwit and outmaneuver your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2. Explosive Visuals:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a kaleidoscope of colors with every clash of shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch in awe as the battlefield becomes a canvas of vibrant explosions, creating a visually stunning spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>4. Tactical Showdowns:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic battles where the goal is simple: reduce your opponent's health to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of timing and precision to land your shapes squarely on target and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>5. Dynamic Arenas:</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across a range of dynamic arenas, each with its own challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the ever-changing battlefield, where the right move at the right time can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an exhilarating clash of colors, shapes, and tactics in MANA. Will you be the strategist who outmaneuvers the opposition and emerges victorious, or will your opponent paint the battlefield with their triumph? The choice of angles is yours \u2013 let the battle for MANA supremacy begin!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the vibrant and mesmerizing world of MANA, where strategic brilliance meets explosive visual spectacle! In this thrilling game, players engage in intense battles by harnessing the power of angles to generate an array of dazzling shapes and colors. MANA takes the age-old concept of strategic warfare and infuses it with a visually stunning and uniquely dynamic twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1. Shape Your Destiny:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the power of angles as you strategically choose the trajectory of your colorful shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every angle matters \u2013 plan your moves carefully to outwit and outmaneuver your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>2. Explosive Visuals:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a kaleidoscope of colors with every clash of shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch in awe as the battlefield becomes a canvas of vibrant explosions, creating a visually stunning spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>4. Tactical Showdowns:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic battles where the goal is simple: reduce your opponent's health to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of timing and precision to land your shapes squarely on target and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>5. Dynamic Arenas:</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across a range of dynamic arenas, each with its own challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the ever-changing battlefield, where the right move at the right time can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an exhilarating clash of colors, shapes, and tactics in MANA. Will you be the strategist who outmaneuvers the opposition and emerges victorious, or will your opponent paint the battlefield with their triumph? The choice of angles is yours \u2013 let the battle for MANA supremacy begin!</p>",
